eReadyDependents (BLOCKED → READY once every dependency SUCCEEDED) · settleExecution" style="verticalAlign=bottom;align=left;spacingLeft=4;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;endArrow=block;endFill=1;html=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1315" y="1398" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1115" y="1398" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="4-43" value="29. once the pass has committed: ReleaseFinished → Release(handle)" style="verticalAlign=bottom;align=left;spacingLeft=4;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;endArrow=block;endFill=1;html=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1315" y="1434" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1515" y="1434" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="4-44" value="30. deleteJob · deleteConfigMap" style="verticalAlign=bottom;align=left;spacingLeft=4;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;endArrow=block;endFill=1;html=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1515" y="1470" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1715" y="1470" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="4-45" value="31. failed: handleFailure → ShouldRetry? READY again after the backoff (claimed by a later pass)&#10;otherwise FAILED → failExecution (execution FAILED; its READY/BLOCKED tasks CANCELLED)" style="verticalAlign=bottom;align=left;spacingLeft=4;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;endArrow=block;endFill=1;html=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1315" y="1550" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1115" y="1550" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="4-46" value="alt  [the task failed instead]" style="fillColor=none;dashed=1;strokeColor=#b85450;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;fontStyle=1;html=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontSize=11;" vert